@startuml 11-sequence-depart
' UML sequence diagram: a Départ, from choosing the car to sharing the signed PDF (US-050 to US-057).
!include style.iuml
hide footbox
autonumber "<b>0."

actor "Staff" as staff
actor "Client" as client
participant "App\n(iPhone)" as app
participant "Data API +\nPostgreSQL" as db
participant "Storage" as st

== Vehicle · US-050 ==
staff -> app : « Départ », choose an available car
app -> db : create the draft contract
db --> app : car data, current reference set, open damage
app -> st : signed links for the reference photos (≤ 5 min)

== Client · US-051 ==
staff -> app : select or create the renter (+ additional driver)
app -> db : save the client and the draft

== Rental details · US-052 ==
staff -> app : dates, rates, deductible, card (brand, last 4, expiry),\npricing lines typed by hand
app -> db : draft saved as it is typed

== Departure condition · US-053 ==
staff -> app : km out, fuel out (pre-filled, adjustable)
opt something looks different · dashboard photo (optional)
  staff -> app : extra photos + comment, dashboard photo
  app -> st : upload (insert-only)
end

== Signature · US-054, US-057 ==
app -> client : recap + general terms (FR / EN)
client -> app : signs once on the pad
app -> st : upload the signature image first
app -> db : rpc sign_departure(draft, signature, idempotency key)
activate db #F6EFDC
db -> db : one transaction:\ncheck the draft is complete, the car still available\nand the signature file present\nnumber MCR-YYYY-NNNN · freeze revision 1 + SHA-256\ndeparture inspection · signature evidence\ncontract active · car rented · audit
alt car taken by another Départ meanwhile
  db --> app : refused, nothing stored as signed
  app -> staff : explain, go back
else signed
  db --> app : contract number
end
deactivate db

== PDF (signed contracts only) · US-055 ==
staff -> app : choose Français or English
app -> app : HTML template → A4 PDF (expo-print)\nsignature bottom right of every page
app -> st : upload the PDF
app -> db : record the PDF (SHA-256, template and terms versions)
app -> staff : iOS share sheet
note over app, db : If the network drops, the app retries the upload and the call\nwith the same idempotency key: never two contracts.
@enduml
